content.text:
Let's improve the user onboarding of the CLI. Currently everything is handled via "enabled" and then "agents". Instead we create a new interactive flow for "configure" now, we can align the rest later on. Here's the concept with the different conditions. If the conditions are met, the main flow of the command is the one with select mirror and agents.

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>entire configure — onboarding flow</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #141312;
    --panel: #1a1917;
    --raised: #211f1d;
    --text: #d8d4cd;
    --dim: #8a857c;
    --faint: #5a554d;
    --accent: #e8864a;
    --green: #8fbf6f;
    --purple: #a78bfa;

    --ag-claude: #e8864a;
    --ag-codex: #34a37f;
    --ag-copilot: #d162c4;
    --ag-gemini: #5b93e8;
    --ag-opencode: #4cc3c9;
    --ag-pi: #e6c04a;
    --ag-neutral: #7a756c;
  }

  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: "JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    padding: 64px 24px 120px;
  }

  .wrap { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; }

  header { margin-bottom: 56px; }
  header h1 {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  header h1 span { color: var(--faint); }
  header p {
    color: var(--dim);
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  /* branch eyebrow between panels */
  .branch {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin: 40px 0 12px;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--faint);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .branch::before {
    content: "";
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: var(--raised);
    flex: none;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
  }
  .branch em { font-style: normal; color: var(--dim); }
  .branch::after {
    content: "";
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.05), transparent);
    flex: 1;
  }

  .terminal {
    background: var(--panel);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.03) inset, 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
  }

  .line { white-space: pre-wrap; }
  .line + .line { margin-top: 2px; }
  .gap { height: 14px; }

  .cmd::before { content: "$ "; color: var(--faint); }
  .cmd { color: var(--text); }

  .q::before { content: "? "; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
  .q { color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; }

  .ok::before { content: "✓ "; color: var(--green); }
  .ok { color: var(--dim); }
  .ok b { color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; }

  .spin::before { content: "◐ "; color: var(--accent); }
  .spin { color: var(--dim); }

  .stop::before { content: "✗ "; color: #d1705f; }
  .stop { color: var(--text); }

  .arrow::before { content: "→ "; color: var(--faint); }
  .arrow { color: var(--dim); }
  .arrow b { color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; }

  .hint { color: var(--faint); font-size: 12px; }
  .dim { color: var(--dim); }

  .code {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--raised);
    border-radius: 5px;
    padding: 1px 8px;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
  }

  .url { color: var(--purple); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; text-decoration-color: rgba(167,139,250,0.35); }

  /* checkbox options */
  .opt { padding-left: 20px; color: var(--dim); }
  .opt .box { color: var(--faint); }
  .opt.on { color: var(--text); }
  .opt.on .box { color: var(--green); }
  .opt .tag { color: var(--faint); }
  .opt .dot {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 7px; height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    margin-right: 8px;
    vertical-align: 1px;
    background: var(--ag-neutral);
    opacity: 0.55;
  }
  .opt.on .dot { opacity: 1; }
  .opt.off { color: var(--faint); }
  .opt.off b { color: var(--faint); font-weight: 400; }

  .summary { padding-left: 20px; color: var(--faint); font-size: 12px; }
  .summary b { color: var(--dim); font-weight: 400; }

  footer {
    margin-top: 72px;
    color: var(--faint);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <header>
    <h1>entire configure <span>· onboarding flow</span></h1>
    <p>static prototype — all branches, top to bottom</p>
  </header>

  <!-- ─────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="branch">if <em>no session</em></div>
  <div class="terminal">
    <div class="line cmd">entire configure</div>
    <div class="gap"></div>
    <div class="line dim">  Logging in to: <span class="url">https://us.auth.entire.io</span></div>
    <div class="line hint">  Press Enter to open in browser...</div>
    <div class="gap"></div>
    <div class="line spin">Waiting for confirmation…</div>
    <div class="line ok">Logged in as <b>dipree</b></div>
  </div>

  <!-- ─────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="branch">if <em>no repo access</em> · <em>admin</em></div>
  <div class="terminal">
    <div class="line stop">Entire has no access to <b>entirehq/entire</b></div>
    <div class="gap"></div>
    <div class="line dim">  Install the GitHub app to grant access:</div>
    <div class="line dim">  <span class="url">https://entire.io/install?repo=entirehq/entire</span></div>
    <div class="gap"></div>
    <div class="line spin">Waiting for installation…</div>
    <div class="line ok">Access granted</div>
  </div>

  <!-- ─────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="branch">if <em>not a mirror yet</em></div>
  <div class="terminal">
    <div class="line q">Which regions should this repository live in?</div>
    <div class="line hint">  Space to select · enter to confirm — your data stays in the selected regions.</div>
    <div class="gap"></div>
    <div class="line opt on"><span class="box">◼</span> EU <span class="tag">— Frankfurt · closest to you</span></div>
    <div class="line opt"><span class="box">◻</span> US <span class="tag">— Virginia</span></div>
    <div class="line opt on"><span class="box">◼</span> AU <span class="tag">— Sydney</span></div>
    <div class="gap"></div>
    <div class="line spin">Creating mirrors in <b>EU, AU</b>…</div>
    <div class="line ok">Mirror ready · <b>entirehq/entire</b> → eu.entire.io</div>
    <div class="line ok">Mirror ready · <b>entirehq/entire</b> → au.entire.io</div>
  </div>

  <!-- ─────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="branch">else · <em>not admin</em></div>
  <div class="terminal">
    <div class="line stop">Entire has no access to <b>entirehq/entire</b></div>
    <div class="gap"></div>
    <div class="line dim">  An admin needs to install the GitHub app first.</div>
    <div class="line dim">  Send them this link to continue:</div>
    <div class="gap"></div>
    <div class="line dim">  <span class="url">https://entire.io/install?repo=entirehq/entire</span></div>
  </div>

  <!-- ─────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="branch">if <em>is a mirror</em> · manage-regions hint <em>admin only</em></div>
  <div class="terminal">
    <div class="line q">Which upstream do you want to use?</div>
    <div class="line hint">  Arrow keys to move · enter to confirm</div>
    <div class="gap"></div>
    <div class="line opt on"><span class="box">●</span> AU <span class="tag">— your upstream</span></div>
    <div class="line opt"><span class="box">○</span> EU</div>
    <div class="line opt"><span class="box">○</span> US</div>
    <div class="line hint">  Manage regions: entire mirror · or <span class="url">entire.io/entirehq/entire/settings</span></div>
    <div class="gap"></div>
    <div class="line q">Select the agents you want to use</div>
    <div class="line hint">  Space to select · enter to confirm</div>
    <div class="gap"></div>
    <div class="line opt on"><span class="box">◼</span> <span class="dot" style="background:var(--ag-claude)"></span>Claude Code</div>
    <div class="line opt on"><span class="box">◼</span> <span class="dot" style="background:var(--ag-codex)"></span>Codex</div>
    <div class="line opt"><span class="box">◻</span> <span class="dot" style="background:var(--ag-copilot)"></span>Copilot CLI</div>
    <div class="line opt"><span class="box">◻</span> <span class="dot"></span>Cursor</div>
    <div class="line opt"><span class="box">◻</span> <span class="dot"></span>Factory AI Droid</div>
    <div class="line opt"><span class="box">◻</span> <span class="dot" style="background:var(--ag-gemini)"></span>Gemini CLI</div>
    <div class="line opt"><span class="box">◻</span> <span class="dot" style="background:var(--ag-opencode)"></span>OpenCode</div>
    <div class="line opt on"><span class="box">◼</span> <span class="dot" style="background:var(--ag-pi)"></span>Pi</div>
    <div class="line opt"><span class="box">◻</span> <span class="dot"></span>Other agent…</div>
    <div class="gap"></div>
    <div class="line summary">Selected: <b>Claude Code, Codex, Pi</b></div>
    <div class="gap"></div>
    <div class="line q">Save configuration</div>
    <div class="line hint">  Arrow keys to move · enter to confirm</div>
    <div class="gap"></div>
    <div class="line opt on"><span class="box">●</span> Push to <b>main</b></div>
    <div class="line opt"><span class="box">○</span> Push to a new branch <span class="tag">— review before it lands</span></div>
    <div class="gap"></div>
    <div class="line ok">Wrote <b>.entire/config.json</b></div>
    <div class="line ok">Committed <b>chore: configure entire</b> · <span class="dim">a41f9c2</span></div>
    <div class="line ok">Pushed to <b>origin/main</b></div>
    <div class="line ok">Configuration complete</div>
    <div class="gap"></div>
    <div class="line dim">  You're set. Start a session with any selected agent —</div>
    <div class="line dim">  checkpoints will show up on <span class="url">entire.io/entirehq/entire</span></div>
  </div>

  <!-- ─────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="branch">variant · <em>protected branch</em></div>
  <div class="terminal">
    <div class="line q">Save configuration</div>
    <div class="line hint">  Arrow keys to move · enter to confirm</div>
    <div class="gap"></div>
    <div class="line opt off"><span class="box">○</span> Push to <b>main</b> <span class="tag">— protected branch</span></div>
    <div class="line opt on"><span class="box">●</span> Push to a new branch <span class="tag">— review before it lands</span></div>
    <div class="gap"></div>
    <div class="line ok">Wrote <b>.entire/config.json</b></div>
    <div class="line ok">Committed <b>chore: configure entire</b> · <span class="dim">a41f9c2</span></div>
    <div class="line ok">Pushed to <b>origin/configure-entire</b></div>
    <div class="line dim">  Open a trail to merge it:</div>
    <div class="line dim">  <span class="url">https://entire.io/entirehq/entire/trails/new?branch=configure-entire</span></div>
    <div class="gap"></div>
    <div class="line ok">Configuration saved — pending merge</div>
  </div>

  <footer>prototype v1 · non-interactive · entire configure</footer>

</div>
</body>
</html>

